<p>Browse <%= gear_link "women's insulated ski jackets", "womens insulated ski jacket" %>, <%= gear_link "women's ski shell jackets", "womens ski shell jacket" %>, and <%= gear_link "women's base layers", "womens base layer" %>. Snowboarding? See the <%= link_to "snowboard jacket guide", guide_path("snowboard-jacket") %>, and don't forget <%= link_to "warm gloves", guide_path("best-ski-gloves") %>.</p>

